{
  "title": "CHECO26: A China-wide cross-thematic raster database at 1-km resolution for ecological research",
  "description": "<p>CHECO26 v2.3 harmonizes 21,788 Chinese environmental layers on a 1 km China Albers grid.</p><p>The proposed deposit contains 21,685 layers, including 21,637 OPEN layers and 48 Hydrography90m derivatives under CC BY-NC 4.0. Twenty-five NESDC layers are pending licence confirmation, five HydroSHEDS layers are restricted, and 73 layers are retained internally for quality. The raster deposit is pending.</p>",
